References
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The DXF and SVG readers (internal/dxf, internal/svgdraw, internal/cad) were
written from these public specifications. No code was copied from them.

- Autodesk, "DXF Reference" (AutoCAD 2012 and later editions).
- W3C, "Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG) 1.1 (Second Edition)", in particular
  Appendix F.6, which gives the elliptical arc conversion used in
  internal/svgdraw/path.go.

The DWG reader (internal/dwg) was written from the Open Design Alliance's
"Open Design Specification for .dwg files". ACadSharp
(github.com/DomCR/ACadSharp) was consulted as a cross-check, and a few
details the specification leaves out follow it; each file that does says so:
the R2004 decompressor's leading-literal case, the R2018 header's 64-bit
counts, code-page handling, and parts of the object and entity layouts.

